WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Chair Pose — with Hani

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.520
Breathe in... Reach your arms up high.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:13.040
Breathe out... Bend your knees. Sit back.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:17.560
Breathe in... Lean forward just a little.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:22.080
Breathe out... Ears between your arms.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:26.600
Breathe in... Knees and feet together.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:31.120
Breathe out... Keep breathing slowly.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:34.640
Breathe in... Stand up tall.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:38.160
Breathe out... Arms down by your sides.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.680
Breathe in... Arms up again.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:45.200
Breathe out... Sit back in your chair.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:49.720
Breathe in... Look straight ahead.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:54.240
Breathe out... Strong, steady legs.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:58.760
Breathe in... Arms in line with your back.

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:03.280
Breathe out... You are doing great!

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:06.800
Breathe in... Push up to stand.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:10.320
Breathe out... Lower your arms.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:19.320
Fun fact! Your leg muscles are some of the strongest in your body. They help you jump and climb!

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:22.840
Breathe in... Reach up high.

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:26.360
Breathe out... Bend your knees. Hips back.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:30.880
Breathe in... Feel your legs working.

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:35.400
Breathe out... Long, straight back.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:39.920
Breathe in... Fingers reach up.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:44.440
Breathe out... Hold. Almost there.

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:47.960
Breathe in... Stand up slowly.

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:51.480
Breathe out... Arms down. Relax.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:55.000
Breathe in... One last time. Arms up.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.520
Breathe out... Bend your knees. Sit back.

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:03.040
Breathe in... Strong like a chair.

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:07.560
Breathe out... Breathe nice and slow.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:12.080
Breathe in... Last hold. You can do it!

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:16.600
Breathe out... Proud and strong.

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:20.120
Breathe in... Stand up tall.

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:23.640
Breathe out... Arms down. Great job!

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:29.640
Nice work! You did Chair Pose. HudsonSeed · Hani
